WEBVTT

00:11:25.868 --> 00:11:30.535
Tonight we have
gathered here

00:11:30.784 --> 00:11:34.784
to do the Puja to
the Devi,

00:11:34.993 --> 00:11:37.660
that is Mahakali
- we can call Her

00:11:37.826 --> 00:11:42.368
or Durga.

00:11:42.910 --> 00:11:47.202
So many types of
forms She has taken,

00:11:47.494 --> 00:11:49.660
to kill

00:11:49.868 --> 00:11:55.702
the negative forces that
are trying to trouble

00:11:55.910 --> 00:11:58.535
or to obstruct,

00:11:58.784 --> 00:12:02.702
or even to grow

00:12:02.910 --> 00:12:07.577
the people who were

00:12:08.535 --> 00:12:12.243
gentle and good.

00:12:15.577 --> 00:12:18.619
Her forms are of
different types

00:12:18.826 --> 00:12:21.702
that we know about,

00:12:21.868 --> 00:12:26.285
that She destroyed
so many rakshasas,

00:12:26.535 --> 00:12:29.951
She destroyed so
many evildoers.

00:12:30.160 --> 00:12:32.535
Also we do not know

00:12:32.784 --> 00:12:36.410
that, in the World
Wars that we had,

00:12:36.660 --> 00:12:42.202
She was there to protect
the right type of people.

00:12:42.452 --> 00:12:45.744
And that’s how
they all survived

00:12:45.910 --> 00:12:49.784
the ill-blood plan,

00:12:49.993 --> 00:12:54.035
ill-gotten plan
of very cruel

00:12:54.285 --> 00:12:57.327
and evil people.

00:12:58.744 --> 00:13:02.619
The evil people have
a capacity to hate.

00:13:02.826 --> 00:13:08.619
And to express their hate in
every way that is possible.

00:13:09.160 --> 00:13:16.826
They are really born evil and
there are also who ‘become’ evil.

00:13:17.452 --> 00:13:21.368
When they are

00:13:22.410 --> 00:13:27.202
born evil, you can
make them out.

00:13:27.410 --> 00:13:31.494
That their whole style
is so aggressive,

00:13:31.744 --> 00:13:36.076
and so vindictive

00:13:36.327 --> 00:13:38.035
about things.

00:13:38.285 --> 00:13:42.118
But hatred has no limit,

00:13:42.368 --> 00:13:47.243
no limits at all.
Because, if they hate,

00:13:47.452 --> 00:13:50.868
if they hate someone,

00:13:51.118 --> 00:13:57.702
then, just to justify that hatred,
they’ll say all kinds of things.

00:13:57.868 --> 00:14:03.285
Just to justify. But sometimes
they don’t even want to justify.

00:14:03.535 --> 00:14:05.619
They just feel that
they ‘hate’

00:14:05.826 --> 00:14:09.619
and it’s a fundamental right
they have got to hate.

00:14:09.826 --> 00:14:15.243
But these forces join
together sometimes to form

00:14:15.452 --> 00:14:20.702
to form a joint
personality of evil,

00:14:20.868 --> 00:14:26.118
which tries to torture the
human beings and trouble them.

00:14:26.327 --> 00:14:31.577
They might take any name. They
might call them by anything,

00:14:31.784 --> 00:14:37.202
but they are absolutely
hundred per cent evil.

00:14:37.494 --> 00:14:39.619
and for such persons

00:14:39.784 --> 00:14:48.035
there’s no pity or compassion
from the God Almighty.

00:14:48.285 --> 00:14:50.660
These are to be
destroyed.

00:14:50.826 --> 00:14:53.368
And that is the job
of the Goddess

00:14:53.619 --> 00:14:59.785
to destroy them, who is a Mother,
full of compassion and love.

00:15:00.452 --> 00:15:04.993
It’s a very contradictory
work the Goddess has to do

00:15:05.243 --> 00:15:10.619
to kill these people, because, in
the larger interest, it is important

00:15:10.826 --> 00:15:18.285
that all such evil people
should be destroyed, completely.

00:15:18.577 --> 00:15:21.243
But they do not.

00:15:21.535 --> 00:15:25.327
They, like they go to jail for
some time. Like that, they

00:15:25.619 --> 00:15:27.660
go to hell for some
time, suffer

00:15:27.868 --> 00:15:30.577
and, again, they come
back much more strong

00:15:30.784 --> 00:15:36.368
and then again try to trouble
good saintly people.

00:15:36.619 --> 00:15:39.494
It’s a common style

00:15:39.702 --> 00:15:45.951
they are all over the world.
They can come in the form

00:15:46.243 --> 00:15:48.410
of a very good man,

00:15:48.619 --> 00:15:53.285
of a very gentle man, or of a
man who “knows a lot about God”

00:15:53.494 --> 00:15:57.619
or they can also say
that they can

00:15:57.910 --> 00:16:00.410
give you Realisation.

00:16:00.784 --> 00:16:04.243
All kinds of lies
they are capable of,

00:16:04.577 --> 00:16:10.035
because they have that power
evil, power of doing evil.

00:16:10.243 --> 00:16:13.327
So they take to all
kinds of falsehood

00:16:13.535 --> 00:16:17.285
and they proclaim that:
“We are this and we are that,”

00:16:17.535 --> 00:16:21.993
and “ We can give
you this or that.”

00:16:23.076 --> 00:16:26.993
Actually, they have come on
this Earth to ruin people.

00:16:27.243 --> 00:16:30.410
We’ve had many of
these false people

00:16:30.660 --> 00:16:33.910
and many stupid
people followed them.

00:16:34.118 --> 00:16:37.202
They never talked
against each other.

00:16:37.452 --> 00:16:41.452
Christ has said that,

00:16:41.910 --> 00:16:45.452
“The devil won’t talk
against its own house.”

00:16:45.744 --> 00:16:49.951
As if they are in ‘one’ house.
And in ‘one’ house they live

00:16:50.202 --> 00:16:52.035
and they cannot talk,

00:16:52.243 --> 00:16:58.202
they cannot talk
of something

00:16:58.452 --> 00:17:02.660
that may disturb their
collectivity or their fraternity.

00:17:02.868 --> 00:17:06.452
The fraternity is so
great that,

00:17:06.660 --> 00:17:09.577
wherever they are,
they ‘know’

00:17:09.826 --> 00:17:14.619
that they are together.
Just imagine.

00:17:14.826 --> 00:17:17.784
all the evil people
should join together

00:17:17.993 --> 00:17:22.202
and behave in this manner
is very surprising.

00:17:22.577 --> 00:17:24.577
That way, they are
very collective.

00:17:24.785 --> 00:17:30.368
Supposing one has taken a
particular part of the land,

00:17:30.660 --> 00:17:34.035
then he dominates there. Another
takes up in another way.

00:17:34.243 --> 00:17:37.410
Third one takes. There’s
no competition as such.

00:17:37.744 --> 00:17:41.243
Ultimate effort is, somehow
or other,

00:17:41.535 --> 00:17:45.702
to destroy all the
creation of God,

00:17:45.910 --> 00:17:47.951
all the good people
of the world,

00:17:48.160 --> 00:17:53.826
who will ultimately get
their Self-Realisation

00:17:54.035 --> 00:17:59.910
and who will have the
Knowledge about Reality.

00:18:00.785 --> 00:18:07.035
This kind of atmosphere is
the worst during Kali Yuga

00:18:07.327 --> 00:18:10.619
and there are so many
stupid, stupid people,

00:18:10.868 --> 00:18:13.826
who may be simple, who
may be good-natured,

00:18:14.118 --> 00:18:19.076
but they get drawn by the
evil doing of these people,

00:18:19.452 --> 00:18:23.494
while the good people
also sometimes

00:18:23.744 --> 00:18:28.035
follow suite. They also try to
follow them. It’s very surprising.

00:18:28.285 --> 00:18:32.785
Why should good people not under-
stand what is good and what is bad?

00:18:32.993 --> 00:18:36.285
But, that discrimination,
many good people also lack

00:18:36.535 --> 00:18:39.410
and that’s why they
take to wrong things.

00:18:39.660 --> 00:18:42.619
And then they go on
justifying all the time

00:18:42.785 --> 00:18:45.327
whatever they are doing
is the right thing,

00:18:45.535 --> 00:18:49.868
is the best thing, they
have the proof of it.

00:18:51.076 --> 00:18:55.868
Now, as you know, there has
been many of them in Kali Yuga

00:18:56.118 --> 00:19:01.660
and so many of them have now
disappeared from this Earth

00:19:02.035 --> 00:19:07.535
and now they cannot trouble us.
But there are still some more,

00:19:07.826 --> 00:19:09.826
who are exposed.

00:19:10.076 --> 00:19:14.035
People have exposed
them so much

00:19:14.285 --> 00:19:17.285
that nobody can expose

00:19:17.744 --> 00:19:21.702
anybody without any proof.

00:19:21.910 --> 00:19:23.951
But they have such courage

00:19:24.160 --> 00:19:28.160
and they are so
full of confidence

00:19:28.410 --> 00:19:31.702
that they can do
what they like,

00:19:31.868 --> 00:19:34.368
and anybody tries
to expose them,

00:19:34.577 --> 00:19:38.452
they will definitely
ruin that person.

00:19:38.784 --> 00:19:40.910
A few things they
are doing.

00:19:41.160 --> 00:19:45.619
First of all, they put wrong
ideas into your head.

00:19:45.910 --> 00:19:48.910
They say that:
"We are very

00:19:49.118 --> 00:19:52.452
great people we are this, we
are that. God has sent us."

00:19:52.660 --> 00:19:54.452
All sorts of things they will talk.

00:19:54.702 --> 00:19:57.243
But there is no proof
about it.

00:19:57.452 --> 00:20:00.577
And human beings never
ask for the proof,

00:20:00.784 --> 00:20:03.243
as to: “How do you say?

00:20:03.452 --> 00:20:05.452
What is the proof? ”

00:20:05.744 --> 00:20:08.785
So the solution is
the Sahaja Yoga.

00:20:09.076 --> 00:20:14.076
In Sahaja Yoga, you have
the experience. You have the proof.

00:20:14.327 --> 00:20:17.243
Then you grow into it.

00:20:17.494 --> 00:20:21.494
Immediately you cannot be a great
Sahaja Yogi, that’s a fact.

00:20:21.744 --> 00:20:23.826
You have to mature.

00:20:24.076 --> 00:20:26.243
It takes some time
for some people.

00:20:26.452 --> 00:20:29.702
It takes some more time for
other people. It doesn’t matter.

00:20:29.993 --> 00:20:31.868
But you do mature.

00:20:32.076 --> 00:20:35.660
In the meanwhile, if you try
to go to these wrong people,

00:20:35.826 --> 00:20:38.243
then there is
no possibility,

00:20:38.535 --> 00:20:42.035
there’s no way of
again bringing you up.

00:20:42.243 --> 00:20:45.744
Especially those people who rise
high in Sahaja Yoga, I think.

00:20:45.910 --> 00:20:49.702
If they fall,
they fall so low.

00:20:49.951 --> 00:20:52.785
Then even an ordinary
Sahaja Yogi

00:20:52.993 --> 00:20:56.285
could say: “ Mother, look at him!
Where has he gone?”

00:20:56.619 --> 00:21:00.577
So, with all these
things happening,

00:21:01.785 --> 00:21:05.951
what is our job

00:21:06.494 --> 00:21:09.744
is to worship
Mahakali within us.

00:21:09.993 --> 00:21:14.660
Because, what does She do?
Perhaps we are not very aware of.

00:21:15.035 --> 00:21:19.993
First and foremost thing
She does is to protect us.

00:21:20.243 --> 00:21:24.452
Wherever you may be,
whatever you may be doing,

00:21:24.660 --> 00:21:27.660
in whatever peril you
may be,

00:21:27.910 --> 00:21:32.035
howsoever dangerously you
may be placed in life,

00:21:32.285 --> 00:21:36.285
She protects you. First
thing, She protects you.

00:21:36.535 --> 00:21:39.951
All the people who write to
Me, how they were protected,

00:21:40.160 --> 00:21:43.494
how they were cured,
how they were helped.

00:21:43.744 --> 00:21:46.327
It’s this thing: that
they should know

00:21:46.535 --> 00:21:52.035
that all this has happened because
of Mahakali power within you.

00:21:52.410 --> 00:21:54.660
She exists within you.

00:21:54.868 --> 00:21:56.784
When you are
worshipping Mahakali,

00:21:56.951 --> 00:21:59.368
you are worshipping the
Mahakali ‘within you’.

00:21:59.577 --> 00:22:01.577
With due respect,
you must know

00:22:01.784 --> 00:22:05.202
that this Mahakali is a
very sensitive personality.

00:22:05.494 --> 00:22:07.784
She is very sensitive.

00:22:08.035 --> 00:22:12.619
If you try to do any
wrong to anyone,

00:22:13.076 --> 00:22:16.660
She’ll guide you. She’ll tell
you by many ways

00:22:16.826 --> 00:22:18.202
that: "This is wrong what
you are doing.

00:22:18.410 --> 00:22:21.202
Why are you doing wrong
to some person?”

00:22:21.577 --> 00:22:23.577
But if you do not repent

00:22:23.784 --> 00:22:28.160
and come back onto the normal
position, She gives you up.

00:22:28.744 --> 00:22:33.243
Once Mahakali gives you
up, you are now exposed

00:22:33.494 --> 00:22:37.619
and become prone to all
kinds of evil things.

00:22:37.826 --> 00:22:40.285
I would say…

00:22:43.452 --> 00:22:46.577
“What’s the matter
with the baby?”

00:23:08.410 --> 00:23:10.993
So, when you worship
Her, what do you want?

00:23:11.202 --> 00:23:16.494
You want Her to protect you.
In your discrimination,

00:23:16.784 --> 00:23:21.202
in your mistake, you might
do something wrong.

00:23:21.452 --> 00:23:25.577
May do something that
is not good for you,

00:23:25.785 --> 00:23:28.660
could be very dangerous
for you.

00:23:28.910 --> 00:23:31.993
But She is the person
who guides

00:23:32.202 --> 00:23:34.368
how to avoid all
the dangers.

00:23:35.619 --> 00:23:39.285
Now, She protects
your life,

00:23:39.535 --> 00:23:41.535
She protects your body,

00:23:41.784 --> 00:23:44.784
She protects all organs
of your body,

00:23:44.993 --> 00:23:50.035
She is the One who gives you
all the security of life.

00:23:51.035 --> 00:23:56.410
In Her realm, you feel
completely secure.

00:23:56.702 --> 00:23:59.452
You are never afraid
of anything.

00:23:59.702 --> 00:24:03.410
Because you have left Her
realm, you have come out of it,

00:24:03.619 --> 00:24:06.702
that is why, that is the
reason you are afraid.

00:24:06.868 --> 00:24:11.702
But if you are under
Her beautiful

00:24:11.910 --> 00:24:14.744
guidance and Her
blessings,

00:24:14.951 --> 00:24:18.202
you will never feel
afraid to do anything.

00:24:18.619 --> 00:24:20.951
You will never do
anything wrong also.

00:24:21.160 --> 00:24:24.993
As soon as you’ll try to do
wrong, She will hold your hand.

00:24:25.285 --> 00:24:27.785
She is really the
guiding person.

00:24:28.035 --> 00:24:32.035
She is the One who actually
gives us our existence.

00:24:32.327 --> 00:24:36.910
Without Her, we
cannot exist, because

00:24:37.327 --> 00:24:44.744
She is the One who is
the Power of Shri Shiva.

00:24:47.035 --> 00:24:51.160
She gives us so many things.
For example,

00:24:51.410 --> 00:24:57.702
She gives us the
relaxation, the sleep.

00:24:58.035 --> 00:25:00.327
She gives you the Truth.

00:25:00.784 --> 00:25:03.410
She tells you what is the
Truth and what is not.

00:25:03.660 --> 00:25:05.035
Sometimes people

00:25:05.285 --> 00:25:08.660
so much in their ego
always try to believe that:

00:25:08.826 --> 00:25:10.535
“What I think is
the truth.”

00:25:10.744 --> 00:25:16.826
Then She is the One who points
it out by creating a ‘Maya’,

00:25:17.076 --> 00:25:21.076
a kind of a confusion,

00:25:21.410 --> 00:25:24.784
that you start thinking:
“What is this?”

00:25:24.993 --> 00:25:30.410
So She is called also the One who
gives us ‘Bhranti,’ means illusions.

00:25:30.660 --> 00:25:33.868
She puts you to illusions
also. She tests you

00:25:34.118 --> 00:25:36.660
puts you to illusions
and She

00:25:36.826 --> 00:25:40.410
then ultimately takes you
out of the illusions.

00:25:41.076 --> 00:25:43.243
She is the One who
relaxes you,

00:25:43.494 --> 00:25:46.826
because She takes over all
your responsibilities.

00:25:47.076 --> 00:25:49.285
She takes over all
your problems.

00:25:49.535 --> 00:25:51.744
She is the One who
solves all the problems.

00:25:51.910 --> 00:25:56.285
It is we who forget to leave
all the problems to Her.

00:25:56.535 --> 00:26:01.494
If you just leave problems to Her,
all your problems are solved.

00:26:01.744 --> 00:26:05.494
Not only that, but you
really feel blessed.

00:26:05.784 --> 00:26:09.951
It’s not only physical,
also it is mental

00:26:10.202 --> 00:26:14.619
that She makes your mind
absolutely free of worries.

00:26:14.826 --> 00:26:19.368
She doesn’t worry and She
doesn’t want you to worry.

00:26:19.619 --> 00:26:22.452
If you worry, then
She tries to show that,

00:26:22.660 --> 00:26:25.868
by your worry,
you are denying Her.

00:26:26.202 --> 00:26:28.494
You are not accepting Her.

00:26:28.784 --> 00:26:30.910
Worrying is something
very common

00:26:31.160 --> 00:26:32.826
and people take great
pride in saying:

00:26:33.076 --> 00:26:34.327
“Oh, I was worried.”

00:26:34.535 --> 00:26:39.327
How can you be worried when your
Mother is “Sakshat Mahakali”.

00:26:39.660 --> 00:26:43.285
She can kill all the demons.
She can finish all of them.

00:26:43.535 --> 00:26:45.243
She knows how
to manage things.

00:26:45.494 --> 00:26:48.535
And when you are like
a child before Her,

00:26:48.784 --> 00:26:51.118
how can you worry
about anything?

00:26:51.327 --> 00:26:53.910
So your worries
are finished.

00:26:54.202 --> 00:26:57.202
She worries about you, you
shouldn’t worry about yourself.

00:26:57.452 --> 00:27:02.118
That’s the point of it. Her
security is so great,

00:27:02.327 --> 00:27:05.494
She is so secure
Herself, that

00:27:05.702 --> 00:27:09.744
She gives you all the
security that you need.

00:27:09.993 --> 00:27:12.577
You can hold on
to Her feet.

00:27:12.784 --> 00:27:17.035
You can hold on to Her
image or to anything.

00:27:17.327 --> 00:27:19.202
You can even pray to Her.

00:27:19.410 --> 00:27:23.494
Many people are being cured
only by praying to Her.

00:27:23.744 --> 00:27:25.702
Because She cures you.

00:27:25.951 --> 00:27:27.868
She can cure your
diseases,

00:27:28.118 --> 00:27:31.784
which are very complicated
diseases. She can cure.

00:27:32.160 --> 00:27:37.035
Now what She likes ?
Mahakali likes the light.

00:27:37.577 --> 00:27:41.744
She is worshipped in the night,
because then we can put on the light.

00:27:42.243 --> 00:27:45.076
She likes enlightened
persons.

00:27:45.285 --> 00:27:49.784
Also She likes the light.
She likes the Sun. She likes,

00:27:49.951 --> 00:27:55.452
something that will be completely
enlightened and brightened.

00:27:56.410 --> 00:28:00.826
You must have heard about people
who are called… I don’t know what,

00:28:01.076 --> 00:28:05.285
but especially in the
West they use them.

00:28:05.535 --> 00:28:10.035
They have big teeth
and they

00:28:10.660 --> 00:28:12.826
somebody from the audience
shouts: “vampires.”

00:28:13.076 --> 00:28:16.784
And they are the people,
they just imagine,

00:28:16.951 --> 00:28:20.951
they cannot exist
before the Sun.

00:28:21.160 --> 00:28:26.951
As soon as there is a sunrise,
they just want to go off and sleep.

00:28:27.202 --> 00:28:32.243
Yes, they cannot see the Sun,
because, the light, they can’t bear.

00:28:32.535 --> 00:28:36.910
Now, what has happened here,
that Mahalakshmi, has departed.

00:28:37.118 --> 00:28:40.285
Mahakali has departed
from them.

00:28:40.619 --> 00:28:45.494
And when Mahakali has departed,
then they are afraid.

00:28:45.744 --> 00:28:49.993
And such people are
attacked by these people

00:28:50.285 --> 00:28:52.910
who know they are afraid.

00:28:53.202 --> 00:28:57.452
The Sun itself is
very important,

00:28:57.702 --> 00:29:00.368
to work out this
Mahakali thing.

00:29:00.619 --> 00:29:04.202
But, as it is, in the
West especially,

00:29:04.452 --> 00:29:07.993
we are very hard-working

00:29:08.243 --> 00:29:12.868
and very much Sun-oriented
and we worship the Sun.

00:29:13.118 --> 00:29:17.452
All this we do,
worship the Sun

00:29:17.702 --> 00:29:20.826
and also go right-sided
very much.

00:29:21.076 --> 00:29:23.660
Then it is She who
gives us the balance.

00:29:23.868 --> 00:29:27.243
She is the One who
gives us the balance,

00:29:27.494 --> 00:29:32.160
by relaxing us completely
and protecting us.

00:29:32.410 --> 00:29:37.784
Sometimes we are competitive
and we are really worried

00:29:37.951 --> 00:29:42.452
and we want to do something
which we cannot do.

00:29:42.826 --> 00:29:46.285
Then we get upset

00:29:46.494 --> 00:29:48.452
and we don’t know
what to do.

00:29:48.702 --> 00:29:53.494
Then it is She who
brings sleep to us.

00:29:53.702 --> 00:29:58.494
So, when we sleep, She looks
after us, She soothes us

00:29:58.744 --> 00:30:01.535
and She takes away
our problems.

00:30:01.744 --> 00:30:03.744
So many things
She is doing.

00:30:03.910 --> 00:30:07.494
But what are we doing for Her?
That we should see.

00:30:08.118 --> 00:30:10.076
Main thing is,

00:30:10.452 --> 00:30:16.452
that we are ourselves
worshipping Her.

00:30:17.619 --> 00:30:22.702
She likes it that Her
children should worship Her,

00:30:23.035 --> 00:30:26.577
that, on that level, She
can be One with them.

00:30:26.784 --> 00:30:31.784
She can give them Her
compassion, love and protection

00:30:31.993 --> 00:30:34.327
from all the evil.

00:30:34.535 --> 00:30:38.826
But it has to be
understood, those who are

00:30:39.076 --> 00:30:43.993
not yet settled, those
who are not absolutelly

00:30:44.243 --> 00:30:50.494
belonging to that land
of security of Mahakali,

00:30:50.784 --> 00:30:52.702
can be attacked.

00:30:52.910 --> 00:30:59.452
And they… once they leave that
area, they can be very badly

00:31:00.327 --> 00:31:04.202
injured, killed, whatever
way can happen.

00:31:04.410 --> 00:31:06.660
So, we are living in
this Kali Yuga

00:31:06.868 --> 00:31:12.619
in very dangerous times.

00:31:12.785 --> 00:31:14.951
Whence anything
can happen.

00:31:15.202 --> 00:31:17.993
So we have to be
very careful.

00:31:18.243 --> 00:31:22.535
We have to watch our mind,
to see how it works.

00:31:22.784 --> 00:31:26.243
What does it teach you?
What does it tell you?

00:31:26.494 --> 00:31:28.076
Try to understand

00:31:28.327 --> 00:31:34.327
what is the plan of
this evil person,

00:31:34.619 --> 00:31:37.785
that you are playing
into his hands?

00:31:38.035 --> 00:31:40.285
How can you play
into his hands

00:31:40.494 --> 00:31:44.744
and how can you do whatever
wrong he wants you to do?

00:31:45.076 --> 00:31:48.494
Secondly, against
Her is the ego.

00:31:48.744 --> 00:31:52.243
The biggest problem
is the ego today.

00:31:52.619 --> 00:31:55.577
Ego will show:
“No, no, I can do this.”

00:31:55.784 --> 00:31:59.243
Ego says:
“I will work it out.”

00:31:59.702 --> 00:32:02.452
Ego says:
“It will be done.”

00:32:02.702 --> 00:32:07.202
But the human beings –
see – yield to ego.

00:32:07.452 --> 00:32:12.285
It’s of a great satisfaction to
them that their ego is so strong.

00:32:12.535 --> 00:32:17.951
and they don’t want to listen
to the Mahakali forces.

00:32:19.910 --> 00:32:23.118
Take the boy (Anant)
outside.

00:32:26.910 --> 00:32:29.951
He wants Me, you see.
Children are like that.

00:32:30.160 --> 00:32:33.784
They can’t leave
you for even…

00:32:38.993 --> 00:32:43.160
You have to be like children.
Really, that’s the very best way,

00:32:43.368 --> 00:32:47.784
is to be innocent like children.
She loves innocent people.

00:32:48.035 --> 00:32:51.826
She is Innocence Herself.
She loves innocent people

00:32:52.035 --> 00:32:54.494
and She looks after
you much more

00:32:54.702 --> 00:32:57.118
because you are innocent.
You are not cunning.

00:32:57.368 --> 00:33:01.076
You are not very much...

00:33:02.327 --> 00:33:07.076
trying to play your
ego on others.

00:33:07.368 --> 00:33:10.368
If you are innocent,
She’ll help you.

00:33:10.619 --> 00:33:12.784
She definitely will
help you.

00:33:12.993 --> 00:33:16.535
But this ego has to be
brought under control,

00:33:16.784 --> 00:33:20.619
because he is
the worst enemy

00:33:20.826 --> 00:33:23.868
She has. She doesn’t
like your ego.

00:33:24.076 --> 00:33:27.243
She wants you to be
ego-less, to be innocent.

00:33:27.452 --> 00:33:33.868
As you know that it is, first She
came and She created Shri Ganesha

00:33:34.243 --> 00:33:37.619
That’s why we worship
Shri Ganesha.

00:33:38.118 --> 00:33:39.784
We have to be innocent.

00:33:39.993 --> 00:33:44.285
Means: we are not
planning to do something

00:33:44.535 --> 00:33:49.368
bad or good or anything, but
we are without any intentions.

00:33:49.577 --> 00:33:57.452
We are just…It’s
a timeless activity.

00:33:57.660 --> 00:34:00.660
You just don’t bother about
what you are going to do,

00:34:00.868 --> 00:34:03.577
what you are not going to do,
what you should do.

00:34:03.784 --> 00:34:05.160
Nothing of the kind!

00:34:05.410 --> 00:34:09.951
You are just existing
in your complete innocence

00:34:10.202 --> 00:34:13.826
and enjoying yourself and
making others enjoy.

00:34:14.035 --> 00:34:18.285
If there’s one child in the house,
he can make hundred people dance.

00:34:18.535 --> 00:34:24.368
It’s like that. Because these
children have the power of innocence.

00:34:24.619 --> 00:34:30.035
and that is what She respects.
We sometimes feel that,

00:34:30.910 --> 00:34:33.744
how people are cheats.
How they cheat us!

00:34:33.910 --> 00:34:38.243
How they make
all kinds of,

00:34:38.993 --> 00:34:44.076
I should say - aggressiveness!
Sometimes, how they try to

00:34:44.327 --> 00:34:46.160
also tell lies!

00:34:46.368 --> 00:34:48.993
All kinds of things
they will do

00:34:49.243 --> 00:34:51.993
and they expect so
much from you also.

00:34:52.243 --> 00:34:57.076
But all this is
happening… is happening.

00:34:57.327 --> 00:34:59.160
You shouldn’t bother
about these things.

00:34:59.410 --> 00:35:01.368
You should keep
to your innocence

00:35:01.577 --> 00:35:05.951
and, you’ll be surprised,
you’ll be completely protected.

00:35:06.868 --> 00:35:11.826
How? Because Mahakali
will stand around you.

00:35:12.035 --> 00:35:16.035
She will look after you,
if you are innocent.

00:35:16.327 --> 00:35:20.868
Innocent person doesn’t get angry.
What is there to get angry?

00:35:21.118 --> 00:35:26.118
Innocence has its
own, I should say,

00:35:26.368 --> 00:35:31.160
strength, power. It’s
extremely powerful.

00:35:31.410 --> 00:35:34.784
Even a cruel man,
if he sees a child,

00:35:34.993 --> 00:35:38.577
he becomes a little bit aware
of it: “There’s a child.”

00:35:38.784 --> 00:35:42.452
The whole world is aware
that children should not be

00:35:42.702 --> 00:35:45.285
any way tortured
or troubled. Why?

00:35:45.577 --> 00:35:51.327
Because children are so innocent.
So the quality of innocence

00:35:51.577 --> 00:35:54.535
is going to really
help you very much,

00:35:54.784 --> 00:36:00.452
because She appreciates
your quality of innocence.

00:36:01.285 --> 00:36:05.744
Then another thing She loves
in you is your compassion.

00:36:05.993 --> 00:36:09.784
Compassion for each other.
Love for each other.

00:36:09.993 --> 00:36:15.160
Also caring for others. That
is something She loves.

00:36:15.577 --> 00:36:18.494
If you are a Sahaja Yogi, if
you are a Realised Soul,

00:36:18.784 --> 00:36:20.035
She is always with you.

00:36:20.285 --> 00:36:25.202
But She says: “What are you
doing with your compassion?

00:36:25.452 --> 00:36:27.784
How many people you are
giving Realisation?

00:36:27.993 --> 00:36:31.951
How many people
you are curing?

00:36:32.243 --> 00:36:34.160
How many people
you are helping?

00:36:34.452 --> 00:36:37.702
She is quite aware of
whatever you are doing.

00:36:37.868 --> 00:36:42.368
I should say, it’s such a
tremendous power of Mahakali

00:36:42.619 --> 00:36:45.702
that She knows
everything about you.

00:36:45.910 --> 00:36:48.327
Everything! She knows
your mind.

00:36:48.577 --> 00:36:50.285
She knows about
your heart.

00:36:50.577 --> 00:36:52.368
She knows about
your health.

00:36:52.619 --> 00:36:56.784
Everything She knows.
Actually, She is the Mother,

00:36:56.993 --> 00:37:01.744
in every way, who cares
for the little child.

00:37:01.993 --> 00:37:05.660
In that way, She knows that
this child doesn’t do anything.

00:37:05.910 --> 00:37:07.118
He’s very innocent.

00:37:07.368 --> 00:37:11.784
So, like, when you are very small,
your mother looks after you.

00:37:11.951 --> 00:37:15.784
In the same way, this
Mahakali looks after you.

00:37:16.035 --> 00:37:20.744
Then the Mahasaraswati
power comes in and She

00:37:21.160 --> 00:37:24.076
educates you.
She gives you

00:37:24.619 --> 00:37:28.826
other ideas of knowledge…
this, that.

00:37:29.076 --> 00:37:32.744
But, looking after
the child in you,

00:37:32.910 --> 00:37:37.368
looking after your innocence
and your compassion,

00:37:37.619 --> 00:37:40.243
is all done by this
Mahakali power.

00:37:40.452 --> 00:37:44.826
So, She is extremely sensitive
about Her children.

00:37:45.243 --> 00:37:47.577
Nobody dare touch
Her children!

00:37:47.784 --> 00:37:51.035
For Her, everybody
is like a child.

00:37:51.285 --> 00:37:55.243
Those who are Realised Souls
especially, She thinks are children

00:37:55.494 --> 00:37:57.951
and in no way they
should be hurt.

00:37:58.160 --> 00:38:01.744
Nothing should happen to them.
She is always following them.

00:38:01.910 --> 00:38:05.285
One can say: “If She is a ‘person’,
how does She follow them?”

00:38:05.535 --> 00:38:10.202
Because She is
‘omnipresent’.

00:38:10.535 --> 00:38:12.993
She is present
everywhere.

00:38:13.243 --> 00:38:16.702
Everywhere in your
life She is there.

00:38:17.118 --> 00:38:21.577
Especially with Sahaja Yogis,
She follows them up and down.

00:38:21.868 --> 00:38:23.118
Everywhere,

00:38:23.368 --> 00:38:24.910
whatever you are doing.
You are in an accident

00:38:25.118 --> 00:38:27.076
She is there to save you.

00:38:27.285 --> 00:38:32.076
She is like an angel behind you
and nothing can happen to you,

00:38:32.285 --> 00:38:35.826
if you really worship Her
from your full heart.

00:38:36.076 --> 00:38:40.826
Not for any gain, not
for any achievement,

00:38:41.035 --> 00:38:44.535
but for Her blessings.

00:38:44.826 --> 00:38:46.784
Her blessings are
very great

00:38:46.993 --> 00:38:51.577
and they really have
enriched human beings.

00:38:51.784 --> 00:38:55.785
They have enriched this Earth.
They have enriched everything,

00:38:56.035 --> 00:39:00.035
because of the
blessings of Mahakali.

00:39:00.744 --> 00:39:03.118
Of course, then, there
comes the Mahalakshmi.

00:39:03.368 --> 00:39:04.702
Her thing is that,

00:39:04.868 --> 00:39:10.285
in Mahalakshmi principle, you
become ‘sort of detached’.

00:39:10.577 --> 00:39:15.118
You start finding that:
“What is this world after all?”

00:39:15.368 --> 00:39:17.784
and a kind of a feeling

00:39:17.993 --> 00:39:23.118
of detachment comes into you
and you start thinking

00:39:23.368 --> 00:39:27.702
that there must be something better,
there must be truth beyond.

00:39:27.951 --> 00:39:31.368
Especially people who have
been tortured by bad people

00:39:31.619 --> 00:39:32.868
always think like that.

00:39:33.118 --> 00:39:37.619
That: “There must be someone
who will raise us from this.”

00:39:37.826 --> 00:39:41.035
Here comes the Mahalakshmi
principle in you

00:39:41.368 --> 00:39:44.327
which is the principle
of the Goddess

00:39:44.744 --> 00:39:48.993
of ‘Ascent’.

00:39:49.243 --> 00:39:54.076
She puts the ideas in your
head that: “What is next?

00:39:54.285 --> 00:39:59.368
What do we have to do? After all,
is this the end of our life?

00:39:59.619 --> 00:40:03.452
What is the purpose of our life?
Why have we come on this Earth?

00:40:03.702 --> 00:40:07.826
What is so special that we
should live on this Earth?”

00:40:08.118 --> 00:40:10.993
All such fundamental
questions start rising

00:40:11.243 --> 00:40:15.619
and then he just takes
to the seeking.

00:40:15.868 --> 00:40:18.327
In that also, you
have to understand

00:40:18.535 --> 00:40:21.785
the Mahalakshmi principle
is very, very,

00:40:22.035 --> 00:40:25.744
very different from what
people understand.

00:40:26.619 --> 00:40:28.410
They think -if
they are seeking,

00:40:28.660 --> 00:40:30.285
it should be intelligible,

00:40:30.494 --> 00:40:32.452
it should be through
their mindsall this…

00:40:32.660 --> 00:40:34.868
or could be rational

00:40:35.076 --> 00:40:37.243
or scientific.

00:40:37.452 --> 00:40:41.535
That’s how they move,
seeking the truth.

00:40:42.368 --> 00:40:44.202
It’s not possible!

00:40:44.619 --> 00:40:46.951
Mahalakshmi’s principle
is like this:

00:40:47.160 --> 00:40:49.744
that you should have earnest

00:40:49.910 --> 00:40:54.410
desire to know the Truth and Truth
and Truth – and nothing else.

00:40:54.993 --> 00:40:56.784
When you think like that,

00:40:56.993 --> 00:40:59.202
then you will not take
to other things.

00:40:59.410 --> 00:41:01.410
So many people took to drugs,

00:41:01.660 --> 00:41:05.784
thinking that, by doing that, they
will achieve their Self-Realisation.

00:41:05.951 --> 00:41:07.368
It’s a wrong idea.

00:41:07.619 --> 00:41:12.577
How can you get away from your awareness?
Can achieve that?

00:41:12.785 --> 00:41:17.035
Awareness is the most
important thing.

00:41:17.285 --> 00:41:19.993
If you can go

00:41:20.619 --> 00:41:24.243
into the realm
of awareness,

00:41:24.494 --> 00:41:28.993
then you have to understand that the
basic awareness is not to be lost.

00:41:29.243 --> 00:41:31.202
If your basic awareness
is lost,

00:41:31.494 --> 00:41:35.784
through drinking or through drugs
or all these things that people do.

00:41:35.951 --> 00:41:39.035
They think that they are seeking,
that’s why they are doing.

00:41:39.243 --> 00:41:45.452
So sometimes they take excuse of
‘seeking’ to do wrong things.

00:41:45.993 --> 00:41:49.535
It’s like a revenge on
your Self, I think,

00:41:49.744 --> 00:41:51.494
that you want
to revenge yourself

00:41:51.702 --> 00:41:56.327
by thinking that you
are now ‘seeking’.

00:41:56.577 --> 00:41:58.619
It’s not the real seeking.

00:41:58.785 --> 00:42:03.784
In a real seeking, a person
has to just meditate

00:42:03.993 --> 00:42:07.285
and should find out
what is the right way.

00:42:07.535 --> 00:42:10.118
But, that too, not by
reading some books

00:42:10.327 --> 00:42:12.868
or listening to
some false gurus.

00:42:13.076 --> 00:42:17.368
Actually, Kundalini
awakening is the only way

00:42:17.619 --> 00:42:21.076
one can know the Reality.
There’s no other way out.

00:42:21.327 --> 00:42:25.368
But nobody tells them that
it is Kundalini awakening.

00:42:25.660 --> 00:42:27.494
They’ll tell you:
“We’ll go to this place,

00:42:27.744 --> 00:42:29.993
then to that place,
then more to that place.

00:42:30.243 --> 00:42:31.494
Then this has
to be done…

00:42:31.744 --> 00:42:34.910
And, ultimately, where do
you come? Where you started!

00:42:35.410 --> 00:42:39.535
Just like that: moving
from places to places.

00:42:39.784 --> 00:42:42.993
Moving from false

00:42:43.243 --> 00:42:47.202
to another false, to another
false,… to falsehood.

00:42:47.702 --> 00:42:50.826
Ultimately so many
seekers have been lost.

00:42:51.118 --> 00:42:54.577
So many have been
lost, because

00:42:55.035 --> 00:43:01.160
they thought that certain
type of… is very precious,

00:43:01.577 --> 00:43:03.118
seeking is very ‘precious’,

00:43:03.368 --> 00:43:06.702
because you can pay lots
of money to the guru.

00:43:06.868 --> 00:43:08.826
I mean, you can
‘purchase’ the guru.

00:43:09.076 --> 00:43:12.619
And so: “All the rich people
can become enlightened.”

00:43:12.784 --> 00:43:13.951
That means that.

00:43:14.160 --> 00:43:19.368
But I don’t think that the percent-
age of good people are only rich.

00:43:19.619 --> 00:43:21.784
The people who are

00:43:21.993 --> 00:43:26.285
good are good. Whether they are
rich or not is not the point.

00:43:26.577 --> 00:43:30.202
But such people try to
gather round a person,

00:43:30.410 --> 00:43:34.327
because, I think, there’s a
subtle ego of their money,

00:43:34.577 --> 00:43:37.951
that: “We can afford to
buy this, buy that.”

00:43:38.452 --> 00:43:42.910
Once I was in America and there
was one lady who came to see Me

00:43:43.160 --> 00:43:47.368
and she didn’t know that I
was… a spiritual person.

00:43:47.619 --> 00:43:52.035
So she said: “Now there’s a very
good guru who has come to America.”

00:43:52.327 --> 00:43:53.868
I said: “Really?
What does he do?

00:43:54.160 --> 00:43:57.702
She said: “There’s a sale
on.” I said: “Really?”

00:43:57.993 --> 00:44:01.285
“You can pay him
half the amount:

00:44:01.577 --> 00:44:04.785
he can give you his blessings.
Alright?”

00:44:05.035 --> 00:44:09.494
Then next week, she said: “Now
the sale has come to one fourth.

00:44:09.784 --> 00:44:11.993
If you pay the one
fourth amount,

00:44:12.202 --> 00:44:14.660
then he will give you
the ‘full’ knowledge.”

00:44:14.826 --> 00:44:17.452
I said: “How can
it be reciprocal?

00:44:17.660 --> 00:44:19.826
It’s not proportionate!”
I said:

00:44:20.076 --> 00:44:23.202
“You were giving half,
he was giving you half,

00:44:23.410 --> 00:44:25.452
and when you are giving
one-fourth, he is giving you full.”

00:44:25.702 --> 00:44:27.327
“That’s the thing”
she said,

00:44:27.535 --> 00:44:31.702
“he’s very magnanimous, you see.
That’s the point.”

00:44:32.202 --> 00:44:37.202
I said: “For all such people who
think they can purchase Truth,

00:44:37.452 --> 00:44:41.784
they cannot achieve it.
You cannot purchase it.

00:44:42.577 --> 00:44:46.868
You cannot pay for your
Kundalini awakening. No!

00:44:47.202 --> 00:44:50.035
Nor you should take any
payment for that.

00:44:50.285 --> 00:44:55.951
Self-Realisation is
absolutely the Divine Grace.

00:44:56.243 --> 00:45:00.160
And you cannot take
money for that.

00:45:00.951 --> 00:45:04.993
You cannot sell it. It’s not
so ‘cheap’ to be sold.

00:45:05.285 --> 00:45:10.619
If you understand that, then
the Mahalakshmi power works.

00:45:10.951 --> 00:45:12.826
And Mahalakshmi power is

00:45:13.076 --> 00:45:16.327
really meant for people who
are really genuine seekers,

00:45:16.619 --> 00:45:21.702
who are really seeking genuinely.
It acts and works so well,

00:45:21.951 --> 00:45:27.076
that they achieve a
kind of a very, very

00:45:27.368 --> 00:45:30.494
spontaneous Realisation.

00:45:30.951 --> 00:45:34.951
This spontaneous Realisation,
you all have got it.

00:45:35.243 --> 00:45:39.285
You don’t have to go to Himalayas. You
don’t have to do anything like that.

00:45:39.494 --> 00:45:43.784
All those things are over.
You have done it.

00:45:44.035 --> 00:45:46.577
In your previous lives,
you must have done it.

00:45:46.784 --> 00:45:48.327
Now you don’t have
to do anything.

00:45:48.577 --> 00:45:52.660
You can get it, you are getting
it just sitting down here.

00:45:52.868 --> 00:45:56.160
Wherever you are in the
whole world, you can get it

00:45:56.410 --> 00:45:58.285
and it is spreading
very fast.

00:45:58.494 --> 00:46:04.826
Now, it’s also the duty of Sahaja
Yogis to spread Sahaja Yoga.

00:46:05.826 --> 00:46:09.784
Now, this one is

00:46:09.993 --> 00:46:14.118
to be understood: that
Mahalakshmi and Mahakali

00:46:14.452 --> 00:46:18.202
both go hand in hand.

00:46:18.452 --> 00:46:22.702
When, you see,
Mahakali blesses you

00:46:22.910 --> 00:46:26.452
and She is with you and
you are in Her realm,

00:46:26.660 --> 00:46:28.577
the Mahalakshmi comes
forward

00:46:28.784 --> 00:46:32.494
and She definitely helps you
to achieve your Realisation

00:46:32.744 --> 00:46:37.035
and also to improve
your problems,

00:46:37.243 --> 00:46:41.202
to help you. I mean - the financial
side of it, you can call it,

00:46:41.452 --> 00:46:43.160
or in any way other

00:46:43.368 --> 00:46:47.494
problems also She solves. The
greatest problem She solves

00:46:47.702 --> 00:46:53.410
that your greatest desire to achieve
Self-Realisation, is granted.

00:46:53.826 --> 00:46:56.910
So, there is no competition
between Them.

00:46:57.202 --> 00:47:00.744
All these three powers
work together,

00:47:00.951 --> 00:47:04.784
and, whatever is needed,
they work it out.

00:47:05.035 --> 00:47:10.660
But it is the Mahakali who
guides where what help has to go

00:47:10.868 --> 00:47:16.160
and that’s why the power of
Mahakali is very much respected.

00:47:16.410 --> 00:47:22.826
As it is, She has killed so many
devils and so many rakshasas

00:47:23.076 --> 00:47:26.784
and there are still more –
some of them are existing

00:47:26.951 --> 00:47:29.076
but I am sure they
will be all finished.

00:47:29.285 --> 00:47:34.951
There will be none of these
horrible ones ever existing.

00:47:35.202 --> 00:47:39.702
But still we have to be
very careful and alert

00:47:39.868 --> 00:47:43.368
and try to find out what’s
wrong with these people.

00:47:43.577 --> 00:47:48.660
What are they doing and what
they trying to propagate?

00:47:48.868 --> 00:47:52.784
You must mature in
such a manner that

00:47:52.993 --> 00:47:58.118
you should know everything
of all these evil doers.

00:47:58.368 --> 00:48:02.202
You must find out what these
false people are doing.

00:48:02.410 --> 00:48:06.327
See, it’s really easy, because
you are enlightened.

00:48:06.577 --> 00:48:10.660
And with your enlightened attention,
you can definitely find out

00:48:10.826 --> 00:48:15.368
what’s wrong with
what organisation,

00:48:15.619 --> 00:48:19.660
with each evil man,
evildoer.

00:48:19.826 --> 00:48:23.243
It will be… the best
way is to meditate.

00:48:23.452 --> 00:48:25.410
Not to be aggressive
in any way.

00:48:25.619 --> 00:48:30.327
But just to meditate and
ask Mahakali: “Destroy!

00:48:30.619 --> 00:48:34.868
Destroy him, for he is destroying
the world. You please destroy him!”

00:48:35.076 --> 00:48:37.327
That’s Her job and
She’d love to do it,

00:48:37.535 --> 00:48:40.327
but somebody has to
tell Her and ask Her.

00:48:40.577 --> 00:48:43.702
It’s very good, because
there are so many,

00:48:43.868 --> 00:48:46.243
that unless and until
you point it out,

00:48:46.494 --> 00:48:49.702
She may not be able to put Her
attention to that - possibly.

00:48:49.868 --> 00:48:54.368
So it’s best is always
ask Her to help you.

00:48:54.577 --> 00:48:58.160
On individual basis.
On a national basis.

00:48:58.368 --> 00:49:03.118
Maybe on a collective basis
or maybe on a global basis.

00:49:03.327 --> 00:49:08.410
That’s what. She exists everywhere.
She is globally available.

00:49:08.660 --> 00:49:10.660
Anywhere: you may
be having

00:49:10.826 --> 00:49:15.577
any colour, any race,
any nation - anything.

00:49:15.784 --> 00:49:19.452
but She exists within
you all the time.

00:49:19.660 --> 00:49:23.160
And to worship Her
and to awaken Her,

00:49:23.410 --> 00:49:27.243
is only ‘your’ due,
that ‘you’ have to do.

00:49:27.452 --> 00:49:30.785
If She is awakened within you,
you’ll be a humble person.

00:49:30.993 --> 00:49:33.619
You will see what mistakes
you have been committing

00:49:33.826 --> 00:49:37.327
and you’ll feel bad about it.
You will not feel ‘guilty’,

00:49:37.577 --> 00:49:38.535
but you will feel ‘bad’,

00:49:38.784 --> 00:49:41.744
that: I will never do such a thing.
I have done very great wrong.

00:49:41.910 --> 00:49:44.202
And then you will
try to correct it.

00:49:44.452 --> 00:49:46.868
All this works out

00:49:47.076 --> 00:49:50.785
very well when you are
pure in your heart.

00:49:51.035 --> 00:49:55.202
Your heart should be pure.
If your heart is not pure,

00:49:55.410 --> 00:50:02.660
if you are doing Sahaja Yoga to
have some competition with others

00:50:02.826 --> 00:50:07.868
or with some sort of material
achievements, it will not work out.

00:50:08.243 --> 00:50:13.660
You have to do it in a way
that is an innocent act,

00:50:13.993 --> 00:50:17.452
that you are worshipping your
Mother like a little child

00:50:17.660 --> 00:50:19.494
worships and loves
his mother.

00:50:19.744 --> 00:50:23.577
It’s a very simple relationship,
which all of us have felt,

00:50:23.785 --> 00:50:26.494
how we should love
our Mother and

00:50:26.744 --> 00:50:32.118
how we should be under Her
guidance and under Her protection.

00:50:32.368 --> 00:50:35.993
That is something very simple you
have known in your childhood

00:50:36.243 --> 00:50:39.118
and that childhood has
to come back in you

00:50:39.327 --> 00:50:42.160
if you really
worship the Mother.

00:50:42.452 --> 00:50:45.619
May God Bless you.